  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the synergies between social protection and public finance management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action aims at supporting partner country government&apos;s effort in social protection policy formulation, and building of social protection systems, including the strengthening of shock-responsive social policies. It puts a strong emphasis on the mutual interconnection with EU budget support operations, macro-fiscal policies, public finance management, with an emphasis on domestic resource mobilization, digital and SDG strategies.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
